s the leaked set photo on the shirt i  already briefly talked about this and  it's pretty self-explanatory ant-man's  helmet is busted kang is in the  reflection so clearly he is the one that  caused it this could be the death of him  or this could simply be a very big blow  to the head either way it's really not  looking good for ant-man but the third  piece of evidence is that the director  said that this movie ant-man and the  wasp quantomania is going to permanently  change the mcu now how will this  permanently change the mcu well there's  a few different answers here all of  which can and probably will happen one  is that ant-man will die this will  obviously permanently affect the mcu it  will permanently affect the avengers and  everybody that ant-man knows and  honestly it's going to be a huge shock  to a lot of people if he does indeed die  i don't think a lot of people think  marvel will do that paul rudd the actor  himself is adored by pretty much almost  everybody and he is fantastic  as scott lang ant-man which is why i  believe that nobody thinks he's actually  going to die so his death will  definitely permanently change the mcu  but i also think that his death will  start the young avengers much like it  did in the comics we already know that  his daughter cassie lang is indeed going  to become stature marvel studios  released the first poster for ant-man  and the wasp quantum mania and it  actually has cassie lang in her stature  suit so this is confirmed and cassie  lange is a very prominent member of the  young avengers in the comics it's also  very clear that marvel studios is  setting up the young avengers as we  already have several of them in the mcu  as it is miss marvel kate bishop billy  and tommy from some universe out there  and more but again in the comics the  death of scott lang is actually the  reason the young avengers are formed now  originally when we first heard about  ant-man 3 insider said that this movie  could introduce the fantastic four  however over the past year everybody has  been saying that it's actually going to  be a setup for the young avengers and  the setup could be the death of ant-man  we also know from the trailer that  cassie lane gets into a lot of trouble  and that scott actually has to pick her  up from jail at some point in time and  this is kind of a classic story arc that  we see a lot in movies in general and  that we've actually seen in ant-man  before ant-man was a criminal then he  became a superhero this is kind of  what's going to happen with cassie she's  going to be some sort of a criminal but  go on to become stature but what changes  her what changes her mindset about life  well it looks like it could be the death  of her father so as you can see there is  a ton of evidence pointing towards the  fact that scott lang ant-man might  actually die in this movie but here's  the kicker if he dies they might  actually bring him back especially if he  dies inside of the quantum realm now i  know some people may not like that some  people always talk about well there  needs to be stakes and there's not  really high stakes in killing somebody  and bringing them back but this is  called ant-man and the wasp quantum  mania and we know that they're going to  spend a lot of time inside of the  quantum realm and the thing is we don't  really know how the quantum realm works  that's what this movie is really going  to tell us what we do know is that time  works differently inside of the quantum  realm ant-man inside of the quantum  realm was only in it for five hours but  in the outside world he was in it for  five years we also know that janet van  dyne was changed inside of the quantum  realm and she now has the ability to  somewhat control some type of energy  these are two things that could actually  bring scott lang back one is time travel  two is the energy that could possibly  heal him to save his life or bring him  back to life basically anything is  possible inside of the quantum realm  which is why they could bring him back  now having said that i do think that it  would be much more of an impact and a  much better demonstration of just how  ruthless and strong king the conqueror  actually is if he permanently kills  ant-man now i don't want ant-man to die  but this would severely affect the mcu  and like the director said permanently  change it and i don't really foresee  ant-man and his team being able to  defeat king the conqueror they may be  able to defeat one variant of him but  like i mentioned even if one variant  dies he can simply transfer his  consciousness into another one so they  could temporarily stop him and maybe  modoc who we know is going to be a  villain in this movie as well but i  don't think overall they are going to  win this fight because remember this  movie is kind of the official start of  the avengers the kang dynasty so this  movie is going to show us just how  strong and ruthless kang is and they  might just do that by killing off  ant-man but let me know what you think  about this in the comments down below  don't forget to like the video and  subscribe to stay up to date on all  things mcu and don't forget to check out  the video by film theory for live  updates you can follow me on instagram  and twitter and as always thank you all  so much for watching woof  me

